title: Commvault Storage Pool %s
agents: commvault_rest
catalog: app/other
license: GPLv2
distribution:
description:
 Checks the status text and capacity of one Commvault storage pool.
 "Online" is OK, "Online (...)" (e.g. a MediaAgent offline) WARN, "Offline ..."
 CRIT, anything else WARN. Capacity, trend and levels use the standard
 "Filesystems (used space and growth)" ruleset. Pools that do not report a
 capacity (tape, cloud, copy pools) only show their status.

item:
 The storage pool name.

discovery:
 One service per storage pool.
